\section{Overview}

[[BerzerkEmulator]] is the concrete implementation of [[BerzerkMachine]]
that wraps the Z80 CPU, memory subsystem, video, sound, and interrupts.
This is a structural refactor of the existing [[EmulatorContext]] -- no
behavior changes. The emulator gains event logging capability for
cosimulation.

